    "category": "backtest_claim",
    "excerpt": "A simple moving average strategy consists in buying and hodling when the closing price is above a moving average. \u2026 As soon as the moving average is above the closing price, it's time to sell and wait for the next buying signal. \u2026 The following calculates a 15-periods Moving Average of the Closing Price: \u2026 The first graph displays in gray the BTC/USD closing price between December 1st, 2017 and May 15th, 2018. \u2026 The 15-days moving average strategy would have generated 130% return on investment",
    "performance_claim": "would have generated 130% return on investment",
    "verbatim_confidence": "high",
    "notes": "15-day SMA close filter, 5.5-month backtest inside Binance era (fully re-testable); date from page metadata (page shows relative time)."
  },
